 0 to 19 years and 65 years or over to population 20 to 64 years)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Rapport de dépendance selon l&apos;âge, 3ème variante (population de 0 à 19 ans et 65 ans ou plus relativement à la population de 20 à 64 ans)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_DE?code=FMEDAGEPOP"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Medianalter der Bevölkerung - Frauen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Median age of population - females</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Age médian de la population - femmes</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_DE?code=JAN"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Bevölkerung am 1. Januar - insgesamt</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Population on 1 January - total</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Population au 1er janvier - totale</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_DE?code=LBIRTH"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Lebendgeburten - insgesamt</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Live births - total</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Naissances vivantes - totales</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_DE?code=MEDAGEPOP"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Medianalter der Bevölkerung</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Median age of population</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Age médian de la population</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="h